From: Chen Minqiang <ptpt52@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: net: airoha: describe NPU DMA pools

Describe restricted streaming and non-reusable coherent DMA pools after
the firmware and optional WLAN reservations. The separate coherent pool
supports contiguous allocations larger than SWIOTLB's per-allocation
limit. Keep the firmware at index zero and accept its existing binary
name as well as the documented firmware name.

Also describe the AN7583 compatible, firmware names, Block Ack region
and SCU phandle used by the existing driver.

Signed-off-by: Chen Minqiang <ptpt52@gmail.com>
---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/airoha,en7581-npu.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/airoha,en7581-npu.yaml
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@ properties:
   compatible:
     enum:
       - airoha,en7581-npu
+      - airoha,an7583-npu
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
@@ -44,18 +45,44 @@ properties:
     oneOf:
       - items:
           - description: NPU firmware binary region
+          - description: Restricted DMA pool for streaming packet mappings
+          - description: Non-reusable coherent DMA pool for mailbox and rings
+        minItems: 1
       - items:
           - description: NPU firmware binary region
           - description: NPU wlan offload RX buffers region
           - description: NPU wlan offload TX buffers region
           - description: NPU wlan offload TX packet identifiers region
+          - description: NPU wlan Block Ack buffers region
+          - description: Restricted DMA pool for streaming packet mappings
+          - description: Non-reusable coherent DMA pool for mailbox and rings
+        minItems: 4
 
   memory-region-names:
+    oneOf:
+      - items:
+          - enum: [firmware, binary]
+          - const: dma
+          - const: coherent
+        minItems: 1
+      - items:
+          - enum: [firmware, binary]
+          - const: pkt
+          - const: tx-pkt
+          - const: tx-bufid
+          - const: ba
+          - const: dma
+          - const: coherent
+        minItems: 4
+
+  firmware-name:
     items:
-      - const: firmware
-      - const: pkt
-      - const: tx-pkt
-      - const: tx-bufid
+      - description: Firmware name of RISC-V core
+      - description: Firmware name of data section
+
+  airoha,scu:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle
+    description: System controller used for SRAM and firmware boot configuration
 
 required:
   - compatible
